{"id":"word:hebrew:H8597","type":"word","title":"תִּפְאָרָה","subtitle":"H8597 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"ornament (abstractly or concretely, literally or figuratively)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תִּפְאָרָה (H8597) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 51 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תִּפְאָרָה (tiphʼârâh) means ornament (abstractly or concretely, literally or figuratively) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 22 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תִּפְאָרָה","transliteration":"tiphʼârâh","pronunciation":"tif-aw-raw'","strong":"H8597","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8597","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["תִּפְאֶ֖רֶת","תִּפְאֶ֣רֶת","תִּפְאַרְתֶּֽ/ךָ","וּ/לְ/תִפְאָ֑רֶת","וּ/לְ/תִפְאָֽרֶת"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",9],["HNcfsc",8],["HC/R/Ncfsa",7],["HNcfsc/Sp2fs",5],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",3],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",3],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",2],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",2],["HC/Ncfsc",2],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"ornament (abstractly or concretely, literally or figuratively)","usage":"beauty(-iful), bravery, comely, fair, glory(-ious), honour, majesty.","full":"H8597. tipharah תִּפְאָרָה noun feminine beauty, glory ; — ׳תּ Isa 28:5 ; Jer 48:17 ; elsewhere absolute and construct תִּפְאֶרֶת Isa 3:18 20 t.; תִּפְאָ֑רֶת Prov 28:12 6 t.; suffix תִּפְאַרְתִּי Isa 46:13 20t. suffix; — 1 beauty, finery Isa 3:18 ; of garments 52:1 ; jewels Ezek 16:17 , 39 ; 23:26 , compare 2Chr 3:6 ; flock Jer 13:20 ; a man Isa 44:13 ; city of Samaria 28:1 , 4 ; diadem 28:5 . 2 glory: a. of rank: apparel of high priest Exod 28:2 , 40 (P); ת ׳עֲטֶרֶת crown of glory Prov 4:9 ; 16:31 ; Isa 62:3 ; Jer 13:18 ; Ezek 16:12 ; 23:42 ; greatness of monarch Est 1:4 ; house of David and inhabitants of Jerusalem Zech 12:7 (twice in verse). b. of renown ולת ׳לְשֵׁם Deut 26:19 ; 1Chr 22:5 ; Jer 13:11 ; 33:9 . c. attribute of ׳י Psa 71:8 ; 1Chr 29:11 ; ת ׳שֵׁם Isa 63:14 ; 1Chr 29:13 ; ׳ת עֹז Psa 89:18 ; ת ׳זְרוֺעַ Isa 63:12 ; hence ׳ת in ׳י s sanctuary Psa 96:6 , תִּפְאַרְתִּ ׳בֵּית Isa 60:7 ; compare 63:15 (of heavenly temple), 64:10 ; ׳ת as ׳י s gift to Israel 46:13 ; compare 60:19 (also Psa 89:18 above); of future fruit of land 4:2 ; designation of ark of ׳י 78:61 . 3. a. honour of nation Israel Lam 2:1 . b. glorying, boasting , of individual, Isa 20:5 ; Prov 17:6 ; 19:11 ; 20:29 ; 28:12 ; warrior Judg 4:9 ; monarchs Isa 10:12 ; nations 13:19 ; Ezek 24:25 , ת ׳מַקֵּל rod (sceptre) of glorying Jer 48:17 (others 1 ). II. פאר (doubtful √).","rootNote":"or תִּפְאֶרֶת ; from 6286 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 22 5","keyReferences":["1Chr 22 5","1Chr 29 11","1Chr 29 13","2Chr 3 6","Deut 26 19","Esth 1 4","Exod 28 2","Exod 28 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":51,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 22 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/לְ/תִפְאֶ֨רֶת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/תִּפְאֶ֨רֶת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּפְאַרְתֶּֽ/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 3 6","book":"2Chr","chapter":3,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/תִפְאָ֑רֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Deut 26 19","book":"Deut","chapter":26,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/לְ/תִפְאָ֑רֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Esth 1 4","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּפְאֶ֖רֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 28 2","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/לְ/תִפְאָֽרֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfsa"},{"r